1
00:00:00,441 --> 00:00:04,191
(Penny:)Oh, okay. Well, I was hoping, um,
you could do me a favor.

2
00:00:04,361 --> 00:00:05,611
(Stuart:)Sure, yeah. Name it.

3
00:00:05,779 --> 00:00:08,279
(Penny:)I'm kind of responsible
for Sheldon missing Stan Lee.

4
00:00:08,449 --> 00:00:10,779
I really wanna make it up to him.
I was hoping...

5
00:00:10,951 --> 00:00:14,201
...you could give me his number
so I can arrange for them to meet.

6
00:00:14,371 --> 00:00:16,791
(Stuart:)Oh, I'm sorry.
I don't have his phone number.

7
00:00:16,957 --> 00:00:18,957
(Penny:)Damn. All right. Thank you.

8
00:00:19,126 --> 00:00:20,456
STUART:
Mm-hm.

9
00:00:20,794 --> 00:00:22,294
(Sheldon:)Wait.

10
00:00:23,297 --> 00:00:24,717
(Stuart:)I have his address.

11
00:00:25,215 --> 00:00:27,465
(Penny:)Really? Great.

12
00:00:27,634 --> 00:00:30,554
(Stuart:)But I can't give it to you.

13
00:00:30,721 --> 00:00:35,141
(Penny:)-Then why did you tell me you had it?
-I don't know. Just chatting.

14
00:00:36,435 --> 00:00:40,645
(Stuart:)You're looking at a guy who could very well
get stood up by a stray cat tonight.

15
00:00:41,815 --> 00:00:43,645
(Penny:)I'm sorry, Stuart. Thanks anyway.

16
00:00:43,817 --> 00:00:45,147
STUART:
Mm-hm.

17
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,490
(Sheldon:)Wait.

18
00:00:48,697 --> 00:00:51,157
(Penny:)-Yeah?
-Maybe we can make a deal.

19
00:00:52,159 --> 00:00:53,239
(Penny:)What kind of deal?

20
00:00:53,994 --> 00:00:58,334
(Stuart:)I will give you the address if you go
to my cousin's wedding with me.

